cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool, please cite it as below."
title: "orcid-finder"
abstract: >-
  A static, client-side web tool that finds the ORCID accounts declaring an
  institution, by ROR id or organisation name, and narrows them by role title,
  start date and whether the appointment is still current. It reports what each
  filter dropped and exports the result as CSV or JSON with the query that
  produced it. Multilingual (EN/DE/ES). Runs entirely in the browser against the
  ORCID public API: no account, no API key, no backend.
type: software
authors:
